KiCad is a separate program (GPL-3.0) and is not shipped in this package.
This MCP server talks to a KiCad PCB editor you already have installed,
over KiCad's official IPC API.

The optional companion package kicad-routing-tools (same GitHub Releases
page) redistributes KiCad Routing Tools (MIT, drandyhaas) plus CPython
3.11 wheels for numpy/scipy/shapely. It is not part of kicad-mcp and
does not share this AGPL license. See that package's copyright file.
